  "FAQ": {
    "title": "Frequently asked questions",
    "subtitle": "Answers to common questions about using Serrbi.",
    "items": [
  {
    "q": "What is Serrbi?",
    "a": "Serrbi is an all-in-one marketplace where you can find jobs, hire trusted professionals, or offer your own services and gigs — all powered by smart automation and AI."
  },
  {
    "q": "Who can use Serrbi?",
    "a": "Anyone! Whether you’re looking for a job, need to hire a professional, or want to earn from gigs — Serrbi connects everyone in one platform."
  },
  {
    "q": "What makes Serrbi different from other platforms?",
    "a": "Unlike typical job sites or gig apps, Serrbi brings together jobs, services, and tasks in one place — with AI Matching, Auto-Apply, and a Resume ATS Analyzer to boost your success rate."
  },
  {
    "q": "How does Auto-Apply work?",
    "a": "Auto-Apply automatically sends you job applications for you based on your profile and preferences, helping you apply to more opportunities while saving time."
  },
  {
    "q": "What is the Resume ATS Analyzer?",
    "a": "Our ATS Analyzer reviews your resume the same way recruiters’ systems do, giving you a score and feedback to help you improve and stand out from other candidates."
  },
  {
    "q": "Can I post or apply for free?",
    "a": "Yes. You can start with the Free plan and post or apply with limited listings. When you're ready to grow faster, upgrade to unlock premium features and higher visibility."
  },
  {
    "q": "Is Serrbi available in my city?",
    "a": "Serrbi is expanding quickly — you can already find professionals and opportunities in major cities, and we’re adding more regions soon."
  }
]

